# ===== Тестовые артефакты, отчёты =====
# Phase 1 field-test runs (PHASE1-01..04) commit GPX exports + battery photos.
# Repo is private (T-01-09-01 in 01-09-PLAN threat model); Phase 4 will add
# privacy-zone clipping before opening the repo. Pattern uses `tests/runs/*`
# (not `tests/runs/`) so that `!` negations on subpaths can re-include
# specific artifacts; with `tests/runs/` the directory itself is ignored
# and git cannot re-include children below it.
tests/runs/*
!tests/runs/.gitkeep
!tests/runs/README.md
!tests/runs/*/
!tests/runs/**/*.gpx
!tests/runs/**/*.md
!tests/runs/**/*.jpg
!tests/runs/**/*.jpeg
!tests/runs/**/*.png
tests/screenshots/
tests/gpx/
*.gpx
!tests/gpx/reference/*.gpx
!tests/runs/**/*.gpx

# ===== Python (smoke scripts) =====
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# ===== Прочее =====
*.tsbuildinfo
.cache/
tmp/
temp/

# ===== Claude Code worktrees =====
# Parallel-execution worktrees live under .claude/worktrees/; never check them in.
# Prior accidental gitlinks (mode 160000) for these paths were removed в Plan 04-02
# Task 5 deviation fix — CI checkout was failing with "no submodule mapping found".
.claude/worktrees/
